{"id":"b6b0fdef2692e665","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-mordell-weil.md","title":"Mordell–Weil Theorem","display":"thm-mordell-weil — Mordell–Weil Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-mordell-weil","aliases":["58-thm-mordell-weil"],"display":"thm-mordell-weil — Mordell–Weil Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve]]","[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-mordell-weil"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-mordell-weil</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mordell-weil — Mordell–Weil Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md\">../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve\">../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> (the set of points of a short Weierstrass elliptic curve over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (number field, i.e. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\\subseteq K\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\subseteq K\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[K:\\mathbb Q]&lt;\\omega\">\\([K:\\mathbb Q]&lt;\\omega\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_E\">\\(+_E\\)</span> (the elliptic-curve group law) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_E\">\\(O_E\\)</span> (its identity)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubgroupCarrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SubgroupCarrier}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MWGenerated}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MWGenerated}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate from dependency)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MWNumberFieldData}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{MWNumberFieldData}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MWCurveGroupLaw}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{MWCurveGroupLaw}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 在下式定义；前者用有限有理线性生成表达有限扩张，后者使用同一短 Weierstrass 记录中的弦切线群律。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}\">\\([\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a>；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(a,b)=[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}\">\\(Q(a,b)=[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{\\mathbb Q}=Q(0,1)\">\\(0_{\\mathbb Q}=Q(0,1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathbb Q}=Q(1,1)\">\\(1_{\\mathbb Q}=Q(1,1)\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{\\mathbb Q}=\\{\\langle\\langle Q(a,b),Q(c,d)\\rangle,Q(ad+bc,bd)\\rangle:a,c\\in\\mathbb Z\\land b,d\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\">\\(+_{\\mathbb Q}=\\{\\langle\\langle Q(a,b),Q(c,d)\\rangle,Q(ad+bc,bd)\\rangle:a,c\\in\\mathbb Z\\land b,d\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q}=\\{\\langle\\langle Q(a,b),Q(c,d)\\rangle,Q(ac,bd)\\rangle:a,c\\in\\mathbb Z\\land b,d\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\">\\(\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q}=\\{\\langle\\langle Q(a,b),Q(c,d)\\rangle,Q(ac,bd)\\rangle:a,c\\in\\mathbb Z\\land b,d\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对下式局部绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_K,\\cdot_K\">\\(+_K,\\cdot_K\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+_Ky\\coloneqq+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(x+_Ky\\coloneqq+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\cdot_Ky\\coloneqq\\cdot_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(x\\cdot_Ky\\coloneqq\\cdot_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>，迭代二元运算按括号次序求值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对局部子群公式中的二元函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+y\\coloneqq+(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(x+y\\coloneqq+(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P+_EQ\\coloneqq+_E(\\langle P,Q\\rangle)\">\\(P+_EQ\\coloneqq+_E(\\langle P,Q\\rangle)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md\">../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MWNumberFieldData}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(K,\\mathbb Q,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\n+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists b\\in K^d\\;\n\\forall x\\in K\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb Q^d\\;\\exists s\\in K^{d+1}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad s(0)=0_K\\land s(d)=x\\land\n\\forall i\\in d\\;s(i+1)=s(i)+_K(q(i)\\cdot_K b(i))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MWNumberFieldData}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(K,\\mathbb Q,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\n+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0_{\\mathbb Q},1_{\\mathbb Q})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists b\\in K^d\\;\n\\forall x\\in K\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb Q^d\\;\\exists s\\in K^{d+1}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad s(0)=0_K\\land s(d)=x\\land\n\\forall i\\in d\\;s(i+1)=s(i)+_K(q(i)\\cdot_K b(i))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MWCurveGroupLaw}_S(\\oplus,E,K,O,K_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,K,O,K_E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\oplus,E\\times E,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nK_E=\\langle+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall P\\in E\\;\\bigl(\\oplus(\\langle O,P\\rangle)=P=\\oplus(\\langle P,O\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x_1,y_1,x_2,y_2\\in K\\;\\Bigl[\\langle x_1,y_1\\rangle,\\langle x_2,y_2\\rangle\\in E\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Bigl(\\bigl(x_1=x_2\\land y_1+_Ky_2=0_K\\to\n\\oplus(\\langle\\langle x_1,y_1\\rangle,\\langle x_2,y_2\\rangle\\rangle)=O\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl(\\neg(x_1=x_2\\land y_1+_Ky_2=0_K)\\to\n\\exists m,x_3,y_3\\in K\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\bigl(x_1\\ne x_2\\to\n(m\\cdot_K x_2)+_Ky_1=(m\\cdot_K x_1)+_Ky_2\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\bigl(x_1=x_2\\to\nm\\cdot_K(y_1+_Ky_1)=\n\\bigl(((1_K+_K1_K)+_K1_K)\\cdot_K(x_1\\cdot_Kx_1)\\bigr)+_KA\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land(x_3+_Kx_1)+_Kx_2=m\\cdot_Km\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land(y_3+_Ky_1)+_K(m\\cdot_Kx_3)=m\\cdot_Kx_1\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\oplus(\\langle\\langle x_1,y_1\\rangle,\\langle x_2,y_2\\rangle\\rangle)=\\langle x_3,y_3\\rangle\n\\Bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MWCurveGroupLaw}_S(\\oplus,E,K,O,K_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,K,O,K_E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\oplus,E\\times E,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nK_E=\\langle+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall P\\in E\\;\\bigl(\\oplus(\\langle O,P\\rangle)=P=\\oplus(\\langle P,O\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x_1,y_1,x_2,y_2\\in K\\;\\Bigl[\\langle x_1,y_1\\rangle,\\langle x_2,y_2\\rangle\\in E\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Bigl(\\bigl(x_1=x_2\\land y_1+_Ky_2=0_K\\to\n\\oplus(\\langle\\langle x_1,y_1\\rangle,\\langle x_2,y_2\\rangle\\rangle)=O\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl(\\neg(x_1=x_2\\land y_1+_Ky_2=0_K)\\to\n\\exists m,x_3,y_3\\in K\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\bigl(x_1\\ne x_2\\to\n(m\\cdot_K x_2)+_Ky_1=(m\\cdot_K x_1)+_Ky_2\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\bigl(x_1=x_2\\to\nm\\cdot_K(y_1+_Ky_1)=\n\\bigl(((1_K+_K1_K)+_K1_K)\\cdot_K(x_1\\cdot_Kx_1)\\bigr)+_KA\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land(x_3+_Kx_1)+_Kx_2=m\\cdot_Km\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land(y_3+_Ky_1)+_K(m\\cdot_Kx_3)=m\\cdot_Kx_1\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\oplus(\\langle\\langle x_1,y_1\\rangle,\\langle x_2,y_2\\rangle\\rangle)=\\langle x_3,y_3\\rangle\n\\Bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subgroup\\text{-}carrier\\text{-}for\\text{-}mordell\\text{-}weil}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubgroupCarrier}_S(H;G,+,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(+,G\\times G,G)\\land H\\subseteq G\\land e\\in H\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;(x+y\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\exists y\\in H\\;\n(x+y=e\\land y+x=e).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subgroup\\text{-}carrier\\text{-}for\\text{-}mordell\\text{-}weil}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubgroupCarrier}_S(H;G,+,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(+,G\\times G,G)\\land H\\subseteq G\\land e\\in H\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;(x+y\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\exists y\\in H\\;\n(x+y=e\\land y+x=e).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mordell\\text{-}weil\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MWGenerated}_S(E,+_E,O_E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(E,+_E)\n\\land O_E\\in E\n\\land\\forall P\\in E\\;(O_E+_EP=P\\land P+_EO_E=P)\n\\land\\exists A\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\n\\land\\forall H\\subseteq E\\;\n(\\mathrm{SubgroupCarrier}_S(H;E,+_E,O_E)\\land A\\subseteq H\n\\to H=E)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mordell\\text{-}weil\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MWGenerated}_S(E,+_E,O_E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(E,+_E)\n\\land O_E\\in E\n\\land\\forall P\\in E\\;(O_E+_EP=P\\land P+_EO_E=P)\n\\land\\exists A\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\n\\land\\forall H\\subseteq E\\;\n(\\mathrm{SubgroupCarrier}_S(H;E,+_E,O_E)\\land A\\subseteq H\n\\to H=E)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mordell\\text{-}weil}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\Bigl[\\exists K_E,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK_E=\\langle+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{MWNumberFieldData}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{MWCurveGroupLaw}_S(+_E,E,K,O_E,K_E)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{MWGenerated}_S(E,+_E,O_E).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mordell\\text{-}weil}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\Bigl[\\exists K_E,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK_E=\\langle+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{MWNumberFieldData}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{MWCurveGroupLaw}_S(+_E,E,K,O_E,K_E)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{MWGenerated}_S(E,+_E,O_E).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The elliptic-curve predicate is called with its actual four arguments, and its carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is the displayed set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-rational points.</li>\n<li>Finite generation is expressed by a finite subset whose subgroup closure is all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>; no unregistered integer-action, torsion accessor, direct sum, or structure-isomorphism notation is used.</li>\n<li>The usual decomposition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(K)\\cong E(K)_{\\mathrm{tor}}\\oplus\\mathbb Z^r\">\\(E(K)\\cong E(K)_{\\mathrm{tor}}\\oplus\\mathbb Z^r\\)</span> is a downstream theorem once those constructions have dedicated atoms.</li>\n<li>Weak Mordell–Weil: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(K)/nE(K)\">\\(E(K)/nE(K)\\)</span> is finite for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n &gt; 1\">\\(n &gt; 1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The Birch–Swinnerton-Dyer conjecture predicts that the rank equals the order of vanishing of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(E,s)\">\\(L(E,s)\\)</span> at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=1\">\\(s=1\\)</span>; this is not part of the theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ 及 $[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}$ 使用 [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]；令 $Q(a,b)=[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}$ 取 [[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q\\subseteq K","display":false},{"tex":"[K:\\mathbb Q]<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"+_E","display":false},{"tex":"O_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubgroupCarrier}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MWGenerated}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MWNumberFieldData}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MWCurveGroupLaw}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}","display":false},{"tex":"Q(a,b)=[\\